---
import MovieFlexLegalLayout from "../layouts/MovieFlexLegalLayout.astro";
---

<MovieFlexLegalLayout
  title="Copyright and attribution"
  description="Ownership and attribution for the MovieFlex interface and third-party catalogue assets."
  eyebrow="CREDITS"
>
  <h2>MovieFlex interface</h2>
  <p>
    © 2026 MovieFlex project owner/operator. Original page layout, code, and
    written interface copy are reserved by their respective creator unless a
    different licence is stated. Reuse of project code requires permission from
    the applicable rights holder or compliance with a separate licence.
  </p>
  <h2>TMDB data and images</h2>
  <p>
    MovieFlex uses TMDB data and images. MovieFlex does not claim ownership of
    TMDB's API output, titles, ratings, or poster and backdrop artwork. This
    product uses TMDB and the TMDB APIs but is not endorsed, certified, or
    otherwise approved by TMDB.
  </p>
  <h2>JustWatch availability data</h2>
  <p>
    Streaming availability information is powered by JustWatch through TMDB's
    watch-provider data. JustWatch and the streaming providers retain their own
    rights in their names, trademarks, and content.
  </p>
  <h2>Logos and trademarks</h2>
  <p>
    TMDB, JustWatch, studio marks, streaming-service names, and other
    third-party trademarks belong to their respective owners. They are shown
    only for identification and attribution. Their presence does not imply
    sponsorship or endorsement.
  </p>
  <h2>Copyright concerns</h2>
  <p>
    If you believe material is being used in a way that infringes your rights,
    contact the project owner through the contact method published on the
    portfolio site and provide the specific URL, a description of the material,
    proof of ownership or authority, and a way to reach you. No dedicated
    copyright contact address is configured on this project at present.
  </p>
  <div class="legal-note">
    Third-party materials remain subject to their owners' licences and terms.
    See <a href="/sources">Data sources</a> for official links and attribution
    references.
  </div>
</MovieFlexLegalLayout>
